      "sourceTextSha256": "72f01eba6e2240a7491761bdc9ce57e5300582e5acc9e0792d73fb695afc1ea4",
      "text": "Embark on an elegant four-day odyssey through the majestic Amazon Rainforest. This unique expedition offers a comprehensive view of the Amazon's rich biodiversity, taking you from the wetlands of the Rio Solimões to the forests of the lower Rio Negro. Learn about local myths and traditions while interacting with indigenous and riverside communities. Under the guidance of our experts, explore the jungle through photo safaris, bird watching, and hiking along water and land trails. Complete this immersive trip with observations of the charming pink dolphins and tucuxis. A truly sophisticated experience that brings together luxury and learning in an unparalleled natural setting.",
